/* 
Expression types:
    1           - Literal
    1+1         - Arithmetic
    1<2         - Comparison
    (1+1) + 1   - Arithmetic + Subexpression
    (1+1) >= 2  - Arithmetic + Comparison
    1+1+1       - MTOO Arithmetic
         (More Than One Operator)
*/